[[2047,31,65536,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The boot opening switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends\nan earth signal, with the boot open, to the integrated services\ncontrol unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 14 of connector C) and, at the same time,\nto the boot light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              and the light on the tail-gate \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G41.</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply for the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT) by the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 7 of connector B) and directly\nfrom the battery (maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) via fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F8</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\njunction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 8 of connector B).</p><p>When the signal that the boot is open arrives,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the timed supply signal, from\npin 2 of connector C, which operates the boot light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              and\ntail-gate light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G41</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply for the glove compartment light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               ignition-operated\n(INT/A) from the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of additional\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , and is activated by an earth signal from the\nglove compartment switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Sun visor lights \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G32</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               are\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT) by the line for fuse\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and is activated by the switch inside\nthe actual light.</p>"]]